        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f12",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Grounds of detention contained 5 grounds on which Central Government satisfied detention necessary as petitioner likely to act prejudicial to security of India and relations with foreign powers.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 1090,
        "end_char": 1330,
        "text_hash": "09172157e5f7fd14",
        "display_location": "0",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "The grounds of detention companytained 5 grounds upon which the Central Government was satisfied that it was necessary to detain the petitioner as he was likely to act further in a manner prejudicial to the security of India and the relations of India with foreign powers."
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": null,
      "court_finding": null,
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f13",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Grounds of detention stated Central Government considered against public interest to disclose further facts or particulars to petitioner.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 1330,
        "end_char": 1600,
        "text_hash": "35643f2717b2c8ed",
        "display_location": "0",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "It was further stated in the grounds of detention that the Central Government companysidered it against the public interest to disclose to the petitioner any facts or particulars as to dates, persons, places, nature of activities and the assistance given by him other than those which had been mentioned in the grounds of detention."
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": null,
      "court_finding": null,
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f14",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Some specimen despatches sent by petitioner and reports in newspaper published in Pakistan annexed to grounds of detention.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 1600,
        "end_char": 1770,
        "text_hash": "c774ee3ff2305ca5",
        "display_location": "0:24",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "The grounds of detention further mentioned that some of the specimen despatches sent by the petitioner and some of the reports appearing in a newspaper published in Pakistan were annexed thereto."
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": null,
      "court_finding": null,
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f15",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Allegation in grounds that petitioner engaged in propaganda against Government of India, Government of Jammu and Kashmir and its administration to bring hatred and contempt.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 1770,
        "end_char": 2200,
        "text_hash": "e826a2e2119a1dc2",
        "display_location": "0",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "From the grounds of detention it would appear that the allegation against the petitioner was that he had been engaged in carrying on propaganda against the Government of India and the Government of the State of Jammu and Kashmir established by law and against the administration of that State Government in a manner calculated to bring into hatred and companytempt the Government of tile State and the Government of India"
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": "petitioner",
      "court_finding": "not_decided",
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f16",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Allegation that petitioner sent despatches to foreign newspaper containing false, incomplete, one-sided and misleading information about Jammu and Kashmir administration, India policy and conditions.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 2200,
        "end_char": 2650,
        "text_hash": "b98c1608a68b5f93",
        "display_location": "0:26",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "that in furtherance of his propaganda the petitioner had been inter alia sending for publication in a foreign newspaper despatches of news and views relating to the State of Jammu and Kashmir companytaining false, incomplete, one-sided and misleading information about the administration of the State by the Government of that State, about the policy of the Government of India in relation to that State and about the companyditions in India in general and in the State of Jammu and Kashmir in particular"
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": "petitioner",
      "court_finding": "not_decided",
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f17",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Allegation that despatches published prominently by newspaper with large circulation in Pakistan and other countries, prejudicial to India and relations with foreign powers.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 2650,
        "end_char": 2920,
        "text_hash": "4064127f3f958ed2",
        "display_location": "0:26",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "that the said despatches were published prominently by the said newspaper, having a large circulation in Pakistan and other foreign companyntries, in a manner prejudicial to India and her cause in relation to the State of Jammu and Kashmir and also prejudicial to the relations of India with foreign powers"
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": "petitioner",
      "court_finding": "not_decided",
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f18",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Allegation that petitioner in regular touch and closely associated with persons hostile to India regarding Jammu and Kashmir and engaged in prejudicial activities.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 2920,
        "end_char": 3110,
        "text_hash": "1222351bcf0cca9c",
        "display_location": "0:26",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "that the petitioner was in regular touch and closely associated with several persons who are hostile to the cause of India in relation to the State of Jammu and Kashmir and were engaged in activities prejudicial to the security of India"
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": "petitioner",
      "court_finding": "not_decided",
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
        "temperature": 0.1,
        "timestamp": "2026-04-04T02:46:34.942354"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f19",
      "type": "fact",
      "text": "Allegation that cumulative effect of petitioner's activities prejudicial to relations of India with foreign powers regarding Jammu and Kashmir and public order.",
      "anchor": {
        "doc_id": "sha256:b26de6f3f947",
        "start_char": 3110,
        "end_char": 3350,
        "text_hash": "6528fafcb20977fc",
        "display_location": "0:26",
        "secondary_spans": [],
        "surface_text": "and that the cumulative effect of the petitioners aforesaid activities was prejudicial to the relations of India with foreign powers in general and particularly in regard to the cause of India in respect of the State of Jammu and Kashmir and the maintenance of public order therein."
      },
      "fact_type": "material",
      "actor_source": "respondent",
      "date": null,
      "date_approximate": false,
      "disputed_by": "petitioner",
      "court_finding": "not_decided",
      "confidence": "high",
      "provenance": {
        "extraction_method": "llm",
        "model_id": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
        "prompt_id": null,
        "run_id": null,
